msgstr "Этот ягодный кустарник готов к уборке."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:959 standard
msgid "This grapevine has just been planted."
msgstr "Виноград посажен."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:966 input:973 standard
msgid "This grapevine is growing."
msgstr "Этот виноград растет."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Grapevine
#: input:980 standard
msgid "This grapevine is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Этот виноград созрел для сбора."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:987 standard
msgid ""
"Ponds with water becomes dry after some time. These dry holes vanish after a "
"while."
msgstr ""
"Пруды с водой через некоторое время пересыхают. Эти сухие ямы через "
"некоторое время исчезают."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Pond
#: input:994 standard
msgid ""
"When gardeners dig up earth, they leave holes with water in the ground. "
"These falls dry after a while or can be used by terraformer to produce new "
"soil."
msgstr ""
"Когда садовники выкапывают землю, они оставляют в земле ямы, заполненные "
"водой. Со временем они высыхают или могут быть использованы терраформером "
"для получения нового грунта."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1001 standard
msgid "This reed field has just been planted."
msgstr "Тростниковое поле засеено."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1008 standard
msgid "This reed field is growing."
msgstr "Тростник растет."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1015 standard
msgid "This reed field is flowering. Honey can be produced from it."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Europeans immovable: Reed Field
#: input:1022 standard
msgid "This reed field is ready for harvesting."
msgstr "Тростник готов к уборке."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: No resources
#: input:1029 standard
msgid "There are no resources in the ground here."
msgstr "Здесь нет ресурсов."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Water
#: input:1036 standard
msgid "There is water in the ground here that can be pulled up by a well."
msgstr ""
"Здесь есть подземные воды. Воду можно получить, построив здесь колодец."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 1
#: input:1044 input:1088 standard
msgid "Coal veins contain coal that can be dug up by coal mines."
msgstr ""
"Угольная жила содержит уголь, который может быть выкопан в угольной шахте."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1046 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of coal here."
msgstr "Здесь есть немного угля."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 1
#: input:1055 input:1099 standard
msgid "Iron veins contain iron ore that can be dug up by iron mines."
msgstr ""
"Железная жила содержит железную руду, которая может быть добыта в железной "
"шахте."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1057 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of iron here."
msgstr "Здесь есть немного железа."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 1
#: input:1066 input:1110 standard
msgid "Gold veins contain gold ore that can be dug up by gold mines."
msgstr ""
"Золотая жила содержит золото, которое может быть выкопано в золотой шахте."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1068 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of gold here."
msgstr "Здесь совсем немного золота."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 1
#: input:1077 input:1121 standard
msgid ""
"Marble is a basic building material and can be dug up by a marble mine. You "
"will also get granite from the mine."
msgstr ""
"Мрамор – это основной строительный материал. Он может быть добыт в мраморной "
"шахте. Там же вы будете добывать гранит."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1079 standard
msgid "There is only a little bit of marble here."
msgstr "Здесь есть немного мрамора."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Coal, part 2
#: input:1090 standard
msgid "There is a lot of coal here."
msgstr "Здесь много угля."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Iron, part 2
#: input:1101 standard
msgid "There is a lot of iron here."
msgstr "Здесь много железа."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Gold, part 2
#: input:1112 standard
msgid "There is a lot of gold here."
msgstr "Здесь много золота."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: input:1123 standard
msgid "There is a lot of marble here."
msgstr "Здесь много мрамора."

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Europeans immovable: Ship Under Construction
#: input:1131 standard
msgid "A ship is being constructed at this site."
msgstr "На этом участке строится корабль."

